  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "Modern WebGL2/WebGPU neuroimaging viewer supporting 30+ formats — BSD-2-Clause, 451 stars, actively maintained (v0.69.0, May 2026). Assess due to pre-1.0 versioning and an ongoing architecture migration to a monorepo. The go-to embeddable viewer for NIfTI-first neuroimaging web applications; distinct from OHIF Viewers which is DICOM-first.",
